  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Support to Girls and Other Vulnerable Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed intervention involves a series of supportive and capacity building activities designed to improve access, retention and completion of learners in targeted schools through provision of bursaries, learning materials; secondly to create a safe learning environment for learners through creation of girls&apos; agency initiatives ; thirdly to reduce harmful cultural factors and negative norms that affect girls education through girls mentorship approach and Ending Violence Against Women and Girls (EVAWG) community campaigns.</narrative>
  </description>
